 location.</li><li>Appointment options or next-step instructions are offered.</li><li>CRM is updated and your team gets routed context.</li><li>Follow-up continues until the lead books, buys, or opts out.</li></ol></div></section><section class="contact-section" id="contact"><div class="wrap"><div class="contact-panel"><div><div class="eyebrow">Let’s make your next step simple</div><h2 data-reveal="words">A better business<br>starts with a conversation.</h2><p>Tell us where leads, customers, or admin work get stuck. We’ll start with a practical assessment and identify the highest-impact automation opportunities.</p></div><div class="contact-actions"><a class="button" href="mailto:jesse@simpleten.ai?subject=AI%20Receptionist%20and%20Lead%20Recovery&amp;body=Hi%20Jesse%2C%0A%0AI%20want%20to%20discover%20my%20SimpleTen%20automation%20opportunities.%0A%0ABusiness%20name%3A%0AWebsite%3A%0ACity%3A%0AThe%20biggest%20leak%20or%20bottleneck%20I%20want%20to%20fix%3A%0A%0AThanks%21">Discover my SimpleTen <span class="arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><a href="tel:+191****8102">Call 916-849-8102</a><a class="contact-email" href="mailto:jesse@simpleten.ai">jesse@simpleten.ai</a><small>Your email app will open with a short assessment request. Prefer a conversation? Give us a call.</small></div></div></div></section></main><footer class="site-footer"><div class="wrap"><div class="footer-top"><div class="footer-brand"><a class="brand" href="/"><img src="/logo-icon.webp" width="21" height="31" alt="">SimpleTen</a><p>Sacramento AI automation for local service businesses. Capture more leads, book more jobs, and automate the busywork.</p></div><div><div class="footer-title">Explore</div><nav class="footer-links" aria-label="Footer navigation"><a href="/ai-receptionist-sacramento">AI Receptionist & Lead Recovery</a><a href="/ai-consulting-sacramento">AI consulting Sacramento</a><a href="/ai-workflow-automation-sacramento">AI workflow automation</a><a href="/ai-agents-sacramento">AI 